      <activity id="1c1fc4d4-1ee8-5d1c-a234-836f6291d6fa" activityNameId="f100eea8-b2cc-546c-86dc-3cc411c18404" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Hard coal, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Hard coal, at regional storage
Average transport distance specific for the country has been used. Dust from transport and load/unload operations is included. Average coal losses are considered. Average emissions to water due to leaching from coal heaps at storage is estimated from the literature.;
UUID: 7130a1fb-513f-3cfa-929a-499cd4c1cbdb
This module includes the transport of the coal to harbours and storage.
Location: Generic values applicable worldwide.
Technology: Not specified
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7130a1fb-513f-3cfa-929a-499cd4c1cbdb.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
